OL,3,GNEWSADerailed carriages are swept for
OL,4,Apassengers' bags
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore carriages from a train that
OL,7,Fderailed near Lewes have been lifted
OL,8,Foff the tracks and searched as
OL,9,Fpassengers wait to be reunited with
OL,10,Ftheir belongings.
OL,12,FA recovery operation is ongoing after
OL,13,Fthe Southern 14:24 BST service from
OL,14,FLondon Victoria to Eastbourne came off
OL,15,Fthe tracks on 13 August, with 150
OL,16,Fpeople on board.
OL,18,FThirty people were injured, two
OL,19,Fseriously. A preliminary report by the
OL,20,FRail Accident Investigation Branch
OL,21,F(RAIB) found a defect in the track
OL,22,Fwhere the train derailed.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
