OL,3,GNEWSADerailed carriages are swept for
OL,4,Apassengers' bags
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish Transport Police are "sweeping
OL,7,Fthe carriages for personal possessions
OL,8,Fas soon as they are safe to enter",
OL,9,Fsaid a spokesperson for Southern.
